rule basket v1
description "The lines of a basket, each with its day, the day it is held to when it is held, its price, the rate taken off it and whether it is a gift: how many are gifts, how many are held, the earliest day, the largest rate and what the lines cost"

# One line of the basket. The caller passes up to five
elements lines
  on      : date           range >=2026-01-01 <=2027-12-31
  held_to : date?
  price   : money[USDc]    range >=0USDc <=10_000USDc
  off     : rate[step 1%]  range >=0% <=50%
  gift    : bool

# Whether a line is kept for a day
table kept_of
policy first
| held_to | -> kept : bool |
| none    | false          |
| -       | true           |

count gifts over lines where gift  range >=0 <=5
count held_lines over lines where kept  range >=0 <=5
min first over lines of on empty 2027-12-31
max most_off over lines of off empty 0%
sum spent over lines of price  range >=0USDc <=50_000USDc

outputs
  gifts      : number  round down(1)
  held_lines : number  round down(1)
  first      : date
  most_off   : rate[step 1%]  round down(1%)
  spent      : money[USDc]  round down(1USDc)
